    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"AnVIL Tutorials\"\noutput: html_document\n---\n\nWhile you can find core documentation at <https://anvilproject.org/learn> and <https://support.terra.bio>, we have also curated vignettes, courses, and books to guide you on your AnVIL journey. Please check out our full collection of AnVIL and related resources below!\n\nThis page was last updated on 29 July 2026.\n\n## AnVIL Materials\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"datatables html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-64ae06ef41373829ba40\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-64ae06ef41373829ba40\">{\"x\":{\"filter\":\"none\",\"vertical\":false,\"data\":[[\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/AnVIL_Book_Champions/\\\">AnVIL: Champions<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/AnVIL_CoFests_2024\\\">AnVIL CoFests 2024<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/AnVIL_CoFests_2025/\\\">AnVIL CoFests 2025<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/AnVIL_Demos/\\\">AnVIL Demos<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/AnVIL_Book_Instructor_Guide\\\">AnVIL: Instructor Guide<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://github.com/fhdsl/AnVIL_WDLs/tree/main\\\">AnVIL WDLs<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/AnVIL_SRA_Data/\\\">AnVIL SRA Data<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/AnVIL_Data_Subsetting/\\\">AnVIL Data Subsetting<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/AnVIL_Poll_2024/\\\">AnVIL Poll 2024<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"http://hutchdatascience.org/Data_on_AnVIL/\\\">Data on AnVIL<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/AnVIL_Book_Epigenetics_Intro/\\\">AnVIL: Epigenetics Intro<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/AnVIL_Book_Getting_Started\\\">AnVIL: Getting Started<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/AnVIL_Phylogenetic-Techniques/\\\">AnVIL Phylogenetic-Techniques<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/AnVIL_Book_WDL\\\">AnVIL: WDL<\\/a>\"],[\"One-stop resource for AnVIL Champions\",\"Information about AnVIL Community Conference CoFest Sessions - November 2024\",\"Information about AnVIL Community Conference CoFest Sessions - Sept 2025\",\"⏱ 30-minute demos and tutorials from our live AnVIL series\",\"A guide for instructors using AnVIL for workshops, lessons, or courses.\",\"Raw WDL workflow files for use on AnVIL and other platforms\",\"Pull Sequence Read Archive (SRA) data into AnVIL\",\"Tutorial for running the fastq_subsample WDL workflow on AnVIL!\",\"A summary of our findings from the 2024 State of the AnVIL user poll.\",\"This is a guide to all the ways to access, upload, and use data on NHGRI's AnVIL platform.\",\"An introductory activity for epigenetics, or the idea of \\\"nature versus nurture\\\" in genetics. Learners use the UCSC Genome Browser.\",\"A guide for getting started using AnVIL\",\"A semester-long course on the basics of molecular phylogenetic techniques\",\"Running and writing your first WDL workflow on AnVIL for absolute beginners.\"],[\"anvil, guide\",\"anvil, conference, workshops\",\"anvil, conference, workshops\",\"anvil, cloud, cloud-computing, course, genomics, module, research, scalable-computing\",\"anvil, course, education, guide, scalable-computing\",\"anvil, genomics, wdl, workflows\",\"anvil, course, genomics, module, ncbi-database, scalable-computing, sequence-read-archive\",\"anvil, course, genomics, module, scalable-computing, wdl, wdl-workflow, workflow\",\"2024, anvil, state-of-the-anvil, user-poll, website\",\"anvil, course, scalable-computing, vignettes\",\"anvil, course, epigenetics, human-genomes, module, scalable-computing, ucsc-browser\",\"anvil, cloud-computing, course, genomics, guide, scalable-computing\",\"anvil, course, phylogenetics, r-programming, scalable-computing\",\"anvil, course, genomics, module, scalable-computing, wdl, workflows\"]],\"container\":\"<table class=\\\"display\\\">\\n  <thead>\\n    <tr>\\n      <th>Book Name<\\/th>\\n      <th>Description<\\/th>\\n      <th>Topics<\\/th>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n  <\\/thead>\\n<\\/table>\",\"options\":{\"autowidth\":true,\"search\":{\"regex\":true},\"pageLength\":100,\"dom\":\"ft\",\"columnDefs\":[{\"name\":\"Book Name\",\"targets\":0},{\"name\":\"Description\",\"targets\":1},{\"name\":\"Topics\",\"targets\":2}],\"order\":[],\"autoWidth\":false,\"orderClasses\":false}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## GDSCN Materials\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"datatables html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-f164fa3aa51f9d8e8a32\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-f164fa3aa51f9d8e8a32\">{\"x\":{\"filter\":\"none\",\"vertical\":false,\"data\":[[\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/AnVIL_Collection/\\\">AnVIL Collection<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"http://hutchdatascience.org/GDSCN_BioDIGS_AMR/\\\">GDSCN BioDIGS AMR<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/GDSCN_BioDIGS_BGC/\\\">GDSCN BioDIGS BGC<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"http://hutchdatascience.org/GDSCN_BioDIGS_Soil/\\\">GDSCN BioDIGS Soil<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/GDSCN_BioDIGS_Book/\\\">GDSCN BioDIGS Book<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://github.com/fhdsl/BioDIGSData\\\">BioDIGSData<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/GDSCN_Book_SARS_Galaxy_on_AnVIL/\\\">GDSCN: SARS Galaxy on AnVIL<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://hutchdatascience.org/GDSCN_SARS_RStudio_on_AnVIL/\\\">GDSCN SARS RStudio on AnVIL<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/GDSCN_Book_swirl/\\\">GDSCN: swirl<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/GDSCN_Book_Statistics_for_Genomics_Differential_Expression/\\\">GDSCN: Statistics for Genomics Differential Expression<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://jhudatascience.org/GDSCN_Book_Statistics_for_Genomics_PCA/\\\">GDSCN: Statistics for Genomics PCA<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"http://jhudatascience.org/GDSCN_Book_Statistics_for_Genomics_scRNA-seq/\\\">GDSCN: Statistics for Genomics scRNA-seq<\\/a>\"],[\"📚 An auto-generating collection of all materials related to the AnVIL and GDSCN projects\",\"This is a BioDIGS in the Classroom companion guide for the BioDIGS project. This particular activity guides students through an investigation of antimicrobial resistance in the BioDIGS samples using Galaxy.\",\"This is a BioDIGS in the Classroom companion guide for the BioDIGS project. This particular activity guides students through exploration of biosynthetic gene clusters in the BioDIGS samples using Galaxy\",\"This is a BioDIGS in the Classroom companion guide for the BioDIGS project. This particular activity guides students through exploration and visualization of the soil characteristics data using R.\",\"Getting started guide for using BioDIGS data in the classroom. Includes general information about BioDIGS.\",\"Data Package for BioDIGS Project\",\"Lab module and lectures for variant detection in SARS-CoV-2 using Galaxy\",\"Lab module and lectures for identifying phylogenetic history of SARS variants using R\",\"Lab exercise: learn basic R programming through interactive swirl lessons\",\"A set of lab modules for an introduction to differential gene expression\",\"A set of lab modules for PCA analysis\",\"A set of lab modules for single cell RNA-seq analysis\"],[\"anvil, content-library, edtech-software, gdscn, website\",\"biodigs, course, data4all, gdscn, module\",\"biodigs, biosynthetic-gene-clusters, course, data4all, gdscn, metagenomics, module\",\"anvil, biodigs, course, data4all, gdscn, module\",\"anvil, biodigs, course, data4all, gdscn, r-programming, tutorial\",\"biodigs, data4all, edtech-software, gdscn\",\"anvil, course, gdscn, genomics, module, sars-cov-2, scalable-computing, variant-detection\",\"anvil, course, gdscn, module, phylogenetic-analysis, sars-cov-2, scalable-computing\",\"course, data-science-programming, gdscn, module, swirl\",\"anvil, cloud-computing, course, gdscn, gene-expression, genomics, module, scalable-computing\",\"anvil, course, gdscn, genomics, module, pca, scalable-computing\",\"anvil, course, gdscn, module, rna-seq, scalable-computing, scrna-seq\"]],\"container\":\"<table class=\\\"display\\\">\\n  <thead>\\n    <tr>\\n      <th>Book Name<\\/th>\\n      <th>Description<\\/th>\\n      <th>Topics<\\/th>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n  <\\/thead>\\n<\\/table>\",\"options\":{\"autowidth\":true,\"search\":{\"regex\":true},\"pageLength\":100,\"dom\":\"ft\",\"columnDefs\":[{\"name\":\"Book Name\",\"targets\":0},{\"name\":\"Description\",\"targets\":1},{\"name\":\"Topics\",\"targets\":2}],\"order\":[],\"autoWidth\":false,\"orderClasses\":false}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n",
